같이 안내합니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■&nbsp;관생실 배정공고 : <font color=\"#0900ff\">파일 첨부</font></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; * 입사 포기자 발생으로 인하여 호실 배정에 있어 변동사항이 있으므로, 재확인 바랍니다.</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (최근 업데이트 일시 : 2013. 12. 23. 11:00)</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></span> 입사 준비물 및 방법 </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 신분증 : 주민등록증, 운전면허증, 여권 중 택 1 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">(학생증 제외)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 개인 비품 : 침구류, 세면도구 등 개인 생활 용품</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 입실 방법 : 입사 등록 후 입실</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></span> 입사 등록</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 절차 : 본인확인 → 열쇠 수령 </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 일정 : </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2013. 12. 24(화) 14:00~18:00</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 장소 : 푸름관-3동 현관, 오름관-식당</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 입사 기간 및 시간&nbsp;이후 입사 : 푸름관-3동 경비실, 오름관-방재실</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></span> 식수 혈관 등록</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -68.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 78.3pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 시간 : </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">입사일 14:00～18:00, 각 관 식사시간(입사 기간 외에는 식사시간에 등록)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 장소 : 각 관 식당</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 방법 : 신분증 제시 후 식수 혈관 등록</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 식사 : </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">12.24(화) 저녁부터 제공 (</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">입사기간 마지막날 중식까지 제공)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">※ 설날[2013.1.30(목)~2.1(토)]은 식사 미 제공</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></span> </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">입사 택배 안내</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 입사 전 생활관으로 보내는 짐 택배(옷, 생필품 등)는 보관할 장소(경비실 협소)가 없고 분실할 우려가 있으므로 입실 날 직접 짐을 가지고 오거나 입실 날에 맞추어 택배가 도착할 수 있도록 조정하여 본인이 직접 택배를 수령하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -24.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 34.1pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2013. 12.</span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -24.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 34.1pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; 금오공과대학교 생활관장</span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            </span>"}
